;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\VSQSE_0591_library_1.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "900" "3000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\背景\ナースステーション.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"By the way, it's already been 2 years since <STYLE ID="1">Niimura-san</STYLE> was admitted, hasn't it?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Right, right. How is she paying for her hospital stay?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Medical insurance, apparently."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Medical insurance? She was only in high school back then. Medical insurance?<PG>
"Her <STYLE ID="2">late mother</STYLE> was overprotective, apparently. 
{PAUSE ""}
She'd taken out a policy that covered advanced medical care, so she'd be ready for anything."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―But apparently <STYLE ID="2">that mother</STYLE> tried to run <STYLE ID="1">Niimura-san</STYLE> over?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"What!? Seriously!?
{PAUSE ""}
　Was she after the insurance money?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―But they say the <STYLE ID="2">mother</STYLE> killed herself right after the accident.<PG>
"Ugh... That reminds me of the Motoki-cho case. 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Niimura-san</STYLE> was connected to the <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="は">flayed</STYLE>-corpse case, wasn't she?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Yeah, and <STYLE ID="4">Kogori-san</STYLE>, the one who comes every day, is the daughter of <STYLE ID="5">that victim</STYLE>, they say.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"So <STYLE ID="1">Niimura-san</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="4">Kogori-san</STYLE> both got dragged into their parents' mess."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Even so, 2 years in the hospital is a lot.<PG>
"That's because it's Motoki-cho, and this hospital. 
{PAUSE ""}
Normally she'd have been discharged or transferred. 
{PAUSE ""}
This town's benefits for its residents are amazing, right?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Well, yeah. That's why it's so hard to move away.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"But apparently 3 years is the limit. 
{PAUSE ""}
Once a full 3 years have passed since admission, it's forced discharge."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Really? Does <STYLE ID="4">Kogori-san</STYLE> know?<PG>
"No way. There's no way anyone could tell her that now..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Yeah... She's so young, and so devoted. It'd be hard to tell her... 
{PAUSE ""}
But isn't taking care of <STYLE ID="1">Niimura-san</STYLE> our job?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"It is, but <STYLE ID="4">Kogori-san</STYLE> says she'll do whatever she can herself."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―That's admirable. Is there some reason for it?<PG>
"Well, you can tell just by watching how <STYLE ID="4">Kogori-san</STYLE> acts, can't you?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Uh...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Well, we're better off just handling it calmly and by the book. 
{PAUSE ""}
Don't get too involved with those two."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―You're right.
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
